      "entries": [
        "The bunyip lets out a loud and horrifying roar. Other creatures within 100 feet must succeed at a DC 21 Will save or become frightened 2 (frightened 3 on a critical failure, frightened 1 on a success, or unaffected on a critical success) No matter the result, the creature is temporarily immune to the effect for 1 minute."
      ],
